	(text "Lamp polarity: LAMP_i is pulled low (display slave relay energised) for letters whose sense relay K is LATCHED\n(= wire live at the instant of STROBE) while S is operated.  Dropped (dead) letters = stecker candidates are the\nletters whose display relay is NOT energised; choose lit/dark at the display with the slave relay NO/NC contact."
